    {
      "id": "p0053-b006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Conversely, some fans who played the official translation first were quick to criticize the unofficial fan translations. These newer fans described the unofficial translations with phrases like \"brain damage\", \"cheesy\", and \"trying too hard\".",
        "raw": "Conversely, some fans who played the official translation first were quick to\ncriticize the unofficial fan translations. These newer fans described the unofficial\ntranslations with phrases like \"brain damage\", \"cheesy\", and \"trying too hard\".",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
