    {
      "id": "p0053-b007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Interestingly, a third group of fans responded to the official release with comments like \"a true fan will play both then interpret stuff however they want\" and \"the official and unofficial translation factions are already waging war, I think I'm gonna get some popcorn and beer and laugh my ass off\".",
        "raw": "Interestingly, a third group of fans responded to the official release with\ncomments like \"a true fan will play both then interpret stuff however they\nwant\" and \"the official and unofficial translation factions are already waging\nwar, I think I'm gonna get some popcorn and beer and laugh my ass off\".",
        "status": "corrected",
