    {
      "id": "p0053-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "It's important to note that this fiery translation debate only took place within a small, loud segment of the fandom. Over time, these arguments cooled down as the official translation took hold. Today, the fan-made translations remain well regarded and serve as examples of the Japanese community's spirit.",
